{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02063","headline":"杂曲歌辞 鹧鸪词 一 · 李涉","name":"杂曲歌辞 鹧鸪词 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"湘江烟水深，沙岸隔枫林。\n何处鹧鸪飞？日斜斑竹阴。\n二女虚垂泪，三闾枉自沈。\n惟有鹧鸪鸟，独伤行客心。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李涉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02063.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02063","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}